  "2026-08-19T22:46:19.837Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: installed Vitest 4.1.11, coverage-v8 4.1.11, and jscpd 5.0.16. pnpm typecheck passed. The tracker-context static gate passed after replacing two generic related edges with typed verifies edges. Exact coverage passed at statements 55694/55694, branches 41593/41593, functions 11540/11540, and lines 53736/53736. pnpm audit reports no known vulnerabilities. Remaining outdated majors are intentionally deferred in pm-do5b and pm-ksr40d."
